**/.local/share/repoharbor/**
# Legacy Orrery XDG paths (migration source; never commit)
**/.config/orrery/**
**/.local/share/orrery/**

# Local git history backups from the rebrand (never publish)
.git.orrery-history.bak/

# Bundled llama-server runtime — fetched by CI into packaging/llama-runtime/ for
